+For your own text, choose **Write...**. Keys **2-9** cycle letters as on a phone; wait a second before the next letter
+on the same key. **0** enters a space, **1** punctuation, and holding a digit enters the digit. **#** cycles uppercase,
+numbers, and lowercase. **Back** deletes; with no text left it returns to Compose. Hold **Back** to cancel and go Home.
+
+The title shows the mode and character count, up to **140 characters** in any message format. **OK** opens the review
+with the recipient in its title. **Up/Down** scroll the complete message; **Back** returns to editing; **OK** sends.
+Nothing is sent on entering the review. If the send cannot start, the text stays there so you can try again.
+Messages you send aren't stored in the radio.
 
